OL,6,     FNorthern Ireland Protesant author,
OL,7,     FClaire Mitchell, frustrated at
OL,8,     Fhaving no place to call home,
OL,9,     Fembarks on a historical and
OL,10,     Fmagical journey, to heal what she
OL,11,     Fcalls her Ghost Limb.
